= Training set — Technical =

== Functional definition ==
For learning algorithm A and training sample S_train:

<pre>
h = A(S_train)
</pre>

Any datum that directly influences fitted parameters/representations through A is functioning as training information.

== Pipeline fitting ==
A pipeline includes learned preprocessing:

<pre>
split
→ fit preprocessing on train
→ transform train/validation/test
→ fit model on train
</pre>

Fitting preprocessing before the split can leak held-out information.

== Reuse ==
In cross-validation, the same observation can be training data in one fold and validation data in another.

Thus “training set” is a role in an evaluation design, not an intrinsic property of a file.

